<!-- HOW IT DIFFERS -->
<section class="difference" id="how">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">A different kind of accounting tool</span>
      <h2>Most accounting software asks. <em>Thalermark answers.</em></h2>
      <p>Every other tool makes you learn double-entry bookkeeping, journal entries, and chart of accounts. Thalermark watches your business and tells you what matters.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="comparison">
      <div class="old">
        <span class="label">The old way</span>
        <p class="quote">"Would you like to create a journal entry? Please select an account from your chart of accounts and enter the debit and credit amounts."</p>
      </div>
      <div class="new">
        <span class="label">Thalermark</span>
        <p class="quote">"You have <em>3 unpaid invoices</em> totalling <em>$1,240.</em> Two are over 30 days. Want me to send reminders?"</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FEATURES -->
<section class="features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">What it does</span>
      <h2>Five things, <em>done well.</em></h2>
      <p>No feature creep, no learning curve. Just the core of running a small business, handled the way it should have been all along.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature">
        <span class="num">01 / Invoices</span>
        <h3>Send an invoice in under sixty seconds.</h3>
        <p>From your phone, between jobs. Stripe link attached. Track delivery, see when it's opened, get notified the moment it's paid.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <span class="num">02 / Expenses</span>
        <h3>Snap the receipt. We'll handle the rest.</h3>
        <p>AI reads the receipt, picks the category, files it correctly. You confirm with one tap or let it auto-file based on your history.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <span class="num">03 / Position</span>
        <h3>One screen tells you exactly where you stand.</h3>
        <p>Money in. Money out. What you're owed. What you owe. No charts you don't understand. No accounting jargon. Just the numbers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <span class="num">04 / Insights</span>
        <h3>The AI watches the cycles you're too busy to see.</h3>
        <p>"January is your slow month. Set aside more in October." "This client pays late 80% of the time." Plain English, drawn from your own data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <span class="num">05 / Taxes</span>
        <h3>Quarterly tax estimates, not surprises.</h3>
        <p>US-first by default. 1099 awareness. Self-employment tax estimated as you go. No financial advice, just awareness, so April never blindsides you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <span class="num">06 / Privacy</span>
        <h3>Opt-in telemetry. Open source. Your data is yours.</h3>
        <p>We collect anonymous usage data only if you say yes. The code is public. The spec is published. You can audit every line.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

