<!-- PRINCIPLES -->
<section class="principles" id="open">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">The principles</span>
      <h2>Open source. <em>Plain English.</em> No paywall traps.</h2>
      <p>Thalermark is built in the open. The community can audit every line of code. The premium tier exists, but the core is yours to keep, forever.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="principles-grid">
      <div class="principle">
        <span class="num">01.</span>
        <h3>Free and self-hosted, forever</h3>
        <p>Run the full open source version on your own server with a single docker compose up. Core features stay free. No bait-and-switch.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle">
        <span class="num">02.</span>
        <h3>Pay for time and intelligence</h3>
        <p>Our managed cloud and AI insights tier exist for people who'd rather not run servers. Reasonable pricing, no rent-seeking.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle">
        <span class="num">03.</span>
        <h3>Telemetry is opt-in, always</h3>
        <p>If you let us see how the product is used, we publish what we learn. The telemetry code is open, the data is anonymous, and you can turn it off in one click.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

